@*
    Math insert buttons for a MathLive <math-field> (wired in take-assignment.js).
    Each button's `data-insert` is LaTeX inserted at the caret; a bare `{}`/`[]`
    pair is MathLive's own placeholder — it lands the caret inside automatically
    and Tab moves to the next one, so "click a button, type into the slot you
    land in" needs nothing extra from us. There is no "$…$" wrap button anymore:
    a math-field's whole content is already math, unlike the old plain textarea
    where LaTeX had to be delimited by hand.
*@
<div class="math-toolbar d-flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-2">
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Square root"     data-insert="\sqrt{}" data-text="√()" data-caret="2">√</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Cube root"       data-insert="\sqrt[3]{}" data-text="³√()" data-caret="3">ⁿ√</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Fraction"        data-insert="\frac{}{}" data-text="()/()" data-caret="1">a⁄b</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Power"           data-insert="^{}" data-text="^()" data-caret="2">xⁿ</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Subscript"       data-insert="_{}" data-text="_()" data-caret="2">xₙ</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Degree"          data-insert="^{\circ}" data-text="°">°</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Integral"        data-insert="\int_{}^{}" data-text="∫">∫</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Multiply"        data-insert="\times" data-text="×">×</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Divide"          data-insert="\div" data-text="÷">÷</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Less or equal"   data-insert="\leq" data-text="≤">≤</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Greater or equal" data-insert="\geq" data-text="≥">≥</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Pi"              data-insert="\pi" data-text="π">π</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Absolute value"  data-insert="\left|\right|" data-text="||" data-caret="1">|x|</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="nth root (custom index)" data-insert="\sqrt[]{}" data-text="ⁿ√()" data-caret="3">ⁿ√x</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Delta"           data-insert="\Delta" data-text="Δ">Δ</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Not equal"       data-insert="\neq" data-text="≠">≠</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" title="Angle"           data-insert="\angle" data-text="∠">∠</button>
</div>
